CloudNet Browser v1.0 is a custom, lightweight web browser designed
for ComputerCraft that turns your shared network storage into an interactive 
cloud internet. It allows users to instantly search for websites using keywords, 
execute live cloud-hosted applications, and navigate text pages seamlessly 
via built-in numeric shortcuts. Creators can easily build pages using an inline
text editor with hyperlink support or deploy full apps by importing local scripts 
directly to custom domains.
